@startuml
' DRAFT Codex / Developer,20.10.2026. Direct Owner feedback and explicit endpoint-house clarification.
title Aspect reading mode: same accepted DTO, focused HTML region, relevant facts only
autonumber
hide footbox
actor User
control "facts / full source index" as Facts
participant "main / page mode" as Main
control "drawing controller" as Controller
participant "passive SVG + pure layout" as SVG
participant "HTML wheel region" as Focus
User -> Facts : native unique aspect activation
Facts -> Facts : S1 full-DТО cardinality remains authoritative
Facts -> Facts : preserve general five/all and house disclosure
Facts -> Main : aspectMode=true
Main -> Main : hide unrelated heading/editor; keep recovery if needed
Facts -> Facts : one aspect row, endpoint points, their published house numbers
Facts -> Controller : new presentation revision, same acceptanceSeq
Controller -> SVG : immutable full facts + selected aspect key
SVG -> SVG : index full source first; display subset second
SVG -> SVG : source cusp band, numbered relevant houses, two endpoints
SVG -> Controller : guarded clone/install of current SVG
Facts -> Focus : focus({preventScroll:true}); initial scroll
Controller --> Facts : current frame settled
alt same selection and user still focuses wheel
  Facts -> Focus : scroll again after reflow, leave sticky return control visible
else retired frame or user left
  Facts -> Facts : no delayed focus or scroll
end
alt button or Escape
  User -> Facts : close aspect
  Facts -> Main : aspectMode=false
  Facts -> Controller : restore full composition
  Facts -> Facts : restore full tables / previous disclosure values
  Facts -> User : focus retained original aspect control if live
else automatic source becomes absent or ambiguous
  Facts -> Facts : reconcile selection to none; preserve source rows
  Facts -> Main : restore complete view, expose S1 warning
else safe-read error
  Main -> Main : show existing recovery controls
  Main -> Focus : return to live wheel when recheck control becomes hidden
end
note over Facts, SVG
Point selection keeps its prior no-focus/no-scroll rule.
No HTTP from selection/close. No house membership, DSC/IC or aspect recalculation.
Unknown time and angle endpoints never receive an invented house.
end note
@enduml
